  "question": {
    "text": "For a first order reaction, if the time taken for completion of 50% of the reaction is 't' second, the time required for completion of 99.9% of the reaction is n 't'. Find the value of n?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.693</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> for first order reaction<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2.303</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>0</mtext><mtext>.693</mtext></mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>t</mtext> <mrow> <mtext>1/2</mtext></mrow> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> <mtext> </mtext><mtext>=</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>2</mtext><mtext>.303</mtext></mrow> <mrow> <mtext>time</mtext></mrow> </mfrac> <mtext> </mtext><mtext>log</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mfenced> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>100</mtext></mrow> <mrow> <mtext>100</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>99</mtext><mtext>.9</mtext></mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow>  <mtext>time</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac>   <mrow>    <mn>6.903</mn></mrow>   <mrow>    <mn>0.693</mn></mrow>  </mfrac>  <msub>   <mtext>t</mtext>   <mrow>    <mtext>1/2</mtext></mrow>  </msub>  <mo>&#x2248;</mo><msub>   <mrow>    <mtext>10t</mtext></mrow>   <mrow>    <mtext>1/2</mtext></mrow>  </msub>  </mrow></math>",
